---
import PageShell from '../components/PageShell.astro';
---

<PageShell title="红楼共读" description="前八十回《红楼梦》与后二十八回《癸酉本》，分册阅读。" activeSection="home">
	<header class="hero hero--books">
		<p class="eyebrow">一部红楼 · 两册相读</p>
		<h1>从这里，选择一本书</h1>
		<p class="lead">全书分为前八十回《红楼梦》与后二十八回《癸酉本》。两册各有自己的阅读设置，互不影响。</p>
	</header>

	<section class="book-shelf" aria-label="选择书册">
		<article class="book-card book-card--hongloumeng">
			<div class="book-card__number" aria-hidden="true">壹</div>
			<p class="book-card__range">前八十回</p>
			<h2>红楼梦</h2>
			<p>由甄士隐梦幻识通灵，读至懦弱迎春肠回九曲。脂批与书批默认隐藏，可在阅读设置中分别开启。</p>
			<div class="book-card__footer">
				<span>第一至八十回</span>
				<a href="/hongloumeng/">进入本册 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
			</div>
		</article>

		<article class="book-card book-card--guiyou">
			<div class="book-card__number" aria-hidden="true">贰</div>
			<p class="book-card__range">后二十八回</p>
			<h2>癸酉本</h2>
			<p>从惜昵近公子做良媒续读至幻中幻境展演情榜。批语默认显示，也会始终尊重读者保存的个人选择。</p>
			<div class="book-card__footer">
				<span>第八十一至一百零八回</span>
				<a href="/guiyou/">进入本册 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
			</div>
		</article>
	</section>
</PageShell>
